  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A vial of dark glass with a silver snake coiled around its neck. The snake's head rests on the stopper, and its eyes are open at dawn and shut for the rest of the day.</p><p><strong>Draw Venom.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you draw the day's dose and coat one weapon or up to three pieces of ammunition; it stays potent until the next dawn. A creature hit by the coated weapon makes a [[/save ability=con dc=20 format=long]], taking [[/damage 12d6 type=poison]] damage on a failed save or half as much on a success. The reliquary fills again at dawn.</p><p><strong>The Viper Chooses.</strong> The venom will not harm anyone the owner loves, whatever weapon carries it and whoever holds that weapon. The owner cannot lie to the reliquary about who that is, and it has been used to find out.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
